{"overview":"سریال «سوجان» روایتگر زندگی در سال‌های ۱۳۱۰ تا ۱۳۵۷ بوده و با محوریت شخصیت مقاوم زن ایرانی و اهمیت نهاد خانواده ساخته شده است. داستان سریال روایتگر زندگی دختری فهمیده و اهل معرفت خانواده گیلانی با نام «سوجان» است که زیر نظر مادربزرگ رشد کرده و نسبت به زمانه خود آگاهی دارد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Sujan is a Gilani girl with kindness and steely will. In the heart of the green forests of the north and in the midst of historical events, he experiences romantic adventures that will change him forever. From the saga of the Jungle Movement to the Pahlavi era, Sujan fights with all his heart for his family and land.","tagline_en":"","runtime":35,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":65,"y":2024,"poster":"/eXCEG8cfZ0q89M34yeNEdBqP7At.jpg"}],"episodes":65,"crew":["hasan tabrizi"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"Sorayya Ghasemi","role":"Madergan","photo":"/gFEcYXAPohwgXYTA1jU0kXO19BU.jpg"},{"name":"Mehrdad Ziaei","role":"Khosrokhan","photo":"/qAoVglzrrAGQt9nhjf8dwpxkWaa.jpg"},{"name":"بهادر زمانی","role":"Sohrab Gol Tapeh","photo":"","en":"Bahador Zamani"},{"name":"غزاله اکرمی","role":"Sujan Gilani","photo":"/iviHXwqSs8IYZ3J9VvxQrnV61w1.jpg","en":"Ghazaleh Akrami"},{"name":"HamidReza Naeimi","role":"Esfandiar Gilani","photo":""},{"name":"بهزاد فراهانی","role":"Heshmat Khan Jafroudi","photo":"/6Hu8aznHA6Un3pHNh5yy83xJlfQ.jpg","en":"Behzad Farahani"},{"name":"Sima Tirandaz","role":"Soraya Jafroudi","photo":"/4yqdooV28LwGd1FdBadPppCHqJe.jpg"},{"name":"بهنام تشکر","role":"Colonel Farzad Monfared","photo":"/4a7g1hnUsGaOaUchWePdBxn9ESA.jpg","en":"Behnam Tashakkor"},{"name":"مهران رجبی","role":"Iskandar Gilani","photo":"/1asVujWbNAV2vmloh51GE4HpVVQ.jpg","en":"Mehran Rajabi"},{"name":"Mehdi Sabaei","role":"Ghulam Ganji origin","photo":"/yu0aD3KrPXnHdZBnPiWJycrWcCb.jpg"},{"name":"رامین راستاد","role":"Ayaz","photo":"/9Hj13ktfUIMwMvR5q548bk23p7A.jpg","en":"Ramin Rastad"},{"name":"Ehsan Amani","role":"Houshang Chai Foroush","photo":""}